DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
10849::$$$message_0084_0000_0000$$$::I still have time until school starts. I'll take a peek at the kyudo club.[lr]::
10850::$$$message_0084_0000_0001$$$::For the longest time, I've wondered whether Sakura's shyness has affected anything or changed since she was appointed captain.::
10851::$$$message_0084_0001_0000$$$::When I head to the door of the archery range, someone also comes from the opposite side.[lr]::
10852::$$$message_0084_0001_0001$$$::And I'd never mistake her striking appearance in uniform and twintails.::
10853::$$$message_0084_0002_0000$$$::"Oh, it's you, Emiya. You're up early for no reason as usual."[lr]::
10854::$$$message_0084_0002_0001$$$::"You too, Tohsaka. Are you trying to join?"[lr]::
10855::$$$message_0084_0002_0002$$$::"That's right. In the half a year until we graduate, we have to make sure to make a splash that resounds in legend for years to come."[lr]::
10856::$$$message_0084_0002_0003$$$::Even while joking around like that, Tohsaka seems to be worrying about Sakura in her own way.::
10857::$$$message_0084_0003_0000$$$::"You're going to go observe too, right?"[lr]::
10858::$$$message_0084_0003_0001$$$::"Of course. [cacheimage storage=凛制服03a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服03a(中) textoff=0]Excuse me!"::
10859::$$$message_0084_0004_0000$$$::"Oh, Senpai... And Tohsaka-senpai as well."[lr]::
10860::$$$message_0084_0004_0001$$$::"Oh hey, Tohsaka and Emiya. Come in, come in!"[lr]::
10861::$$$message_0084_0004_0002$$$::The other members already finished cleaning up and only Sakura and Mitsuzuri were left in the archery range.[lr]::
10862::$$$message_0084_0004_0003$$$::[clfg textoff=0 pos=all time=300]It seems like the two of them just happened to be deep in conversation.::
10863::$$$message_0084_0005_0000$$$::"Morning, Ayako and Miss Matou. Please pardon me."[lr]::
10864::$$$message_0084_0005_0001$$$::[clfg textoff=0 rule=シャッター左から pos=all time=300]Tohsaka seems comfortable enough to just strut in.[lr]::
10865::$$$message_0084_0005_0002$$$::Seems that she hasn't been here for a bit, but I guess it's okay to just let her take the lead today?::
10866::$$$message_0084_0006_0000$$$::"Should I head home, then?"[lr]::
10867::$$$message_0084_0006_0001$$$::"What are you saying?[lr]::
10868::$$$message_0084_0006_0002$$$::The VIPs associated with the club came at a good time, so you should stay."[lr]::
10869::$$$message_0084_0006_0003$$$::"Eh? Is this really the sort of thing to build up like that, Ayako?"[lr]::
10870::$$$message_0084_0006_0004$$$::We all sit down in the waiting area.[lr]::
10871::$$$message_0084_0006_0005$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜弓道着03a(中) textoff=0]There's a bit of strength in Sakura's shoulders.::
10872::$$$message_0084_0007_0000$$$::"See, I talked about it with Emiya, asking if he had any good ideas. Even if we ask our members, we don't get any clear answers."[lr]::
10873::$$$message_0084_0007_0001$$$::"...Sorry for bothering you two."::
10874::$$$message_0084_0008_0000$$$::"It's fine, I'll lend an ear to any concerns if it means that I can help out Miss Matou."[lr]::
10875::$$$message_0084_0008_0001$$$::Beyond her usual posing at school, Tohsaka seems even more confident right now. I guess following her lead was the right decision[line len=2]::
10876::$$$message_0084_0009_0000$$$::"So, what kind of things did you hear, Shirou?"[lr]::
10877::$$$message_0084_0009_0001$$$::"...You mean you brought it up without actually knowing about it?"[lr]::
10878::$$$message_0084_0009_0002$$$::I beckon Tohsaka to the corner of the room.::
10879::$$$message_0084_0010_0000$$$::It's really obvious what we're doing, but when the occasion calls...[lr]::
10880::$$$message_0084_0010_0001$$$::"Sakura mentioned she doesn't have a lot of confidence in leading the club."[lr]::
10881::$$$message_0084_0010_0002$$$::"That's like her. [cacheimage storage=凛制服06b(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服06b(近) textoff=0]But, I heard it got much better."::
10882::$$$message_0084_0011_0000$$$::"From who? Fuji-nee?[lr]::
10883::$$$message_0084_0011_0001$$$::The members who saw what it was like before the tournament said otherwise. Mitsuzuri doesn't let it show, but she's also concerned. The club morale and sense of unity is...not that good."[lr]::
10884::$$$message_0084_0011_0002$$$::It pains me to say such a thing. But in the end, we can't let it continue like that.[lr]::
10885::$$$message_0084_0011_0003$$$::Tohsaka gives a little hum of contemplation[chgfg time=300 storage=美綴弓道着01a(遠) textoff=0] as she considers while peering at me.::
10886::$$$message_0084_0012_0000$$$::"Isn't her issue more that a certain somebody isn't staying by her side?"[lr]::
10887::$$$message_0084_0012_0001$$$::"...That's harsh. But you're in the same position, Tohsaka. Besides, you know that we can't just help her out directly, right?"::
10888::$$$message_0084_0013_0000$$$::"Yeah. She is the club captain and president after all... Then, I have a good idea. [cacheimage storage=凛制服04a(近)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服04a(近) textoff=0]Let me lend a helping hand to my unreliable apprentice and little sister. Leave it to me."[lr]::
10889::$$$message_0084_0013_0001$$$::She nods, then when we get back to the other two...::
10890::$$$message_0084_0014_0000$$$::"You need to form a relationship where you can eat from the same pot."[lr]::
10891::$$$message_0084_0014_0001$$$::...starts working her magic.::
10892::$$$message_0084_0015_0000$$$::"The same pot...[cacheimage storage=美綴弓道着01a(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=美綴弓道着01a(中) textoff=0]you said?"[lr]::
10893::$$$message_0084_0015_0001$$$::"Yes, a sense of unity would form if you had a field trip or barbeque or training camp or something and surround the same dining table."[lr]::
10894::$$$message_0084_0015_0002$$$::"Oh, that's a good idea, Tohsaka."[lr]::
10895::$$$message_0084_0015_0003$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服04c(中) textoff=0]I feel like that's very out of the blue, but she has a point.[lr]::
10896::$$$message_0084_0015_0004$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服03a(中) textoff=0]For example, we have a lot of people living together at my house, but if we all ate meals at different times, then there would be no sense of unity. [fg textoff=0 opacity=0 left=877 index=500 top=120 time=100 storage=蒔寺ジャージ01e(遠)]::
10897::$$$message_0084_0016_0000$$$::"In that case, isn't a training camp good? It's a perfect time for intensive training."[lr]::
10898::$$$message_0084_0016_0001$$$::"Oh... [cacheimage storage=桜弓道着01g(中)][wvl][chgfg time=300 storage=桜弓道着01g(中) textoff=0]Yes, a training camp..."[lr]::
10899::$$$message_0084_0016_0002$$$::"Yeah, if you're going on one, I'll help out. You will too, right, Tohsaka?"[lr]::
10900::$$$message_0084_0016_0003$$$::She didn't offer to go herself, but since she did suggest it, I think she should go.[lr]::
10901::$$$message_0084_0016_0004$$$::...Though I'm not sure why she's looking at me like that.::
10902::$$$message_0084_0017_0000$$$::"You want...[cacheimage storage=凛制服02c(中)][wvl canskip=0 time=400][chgfg time=300 storage=凛制服02c(中) textoff=0]me to go to the training camp?"[lr]::
10903::$$$message_0084_0017_0001$$$::"What, you're not coming even though Emiya says he's going? Outsiders are welcome to participate."[lr]::
10904::$$$message_0084_0017_0002$$$::"Oh... I would be grateful if you also came..."::
10905::$$$message_0084_0018_0000$$$::It's three versus one for her to come along.[lr]::
10906::$$$message_0084_0018_0001$$$::Unfortunately, she's not the type that bows down to the majority in a situation like this...::
10907::$$$message_0084_0019_0000$$$::"Ehh, I [font italic=true]suppose[font italic=false] I would tag along if it involves a buffet or barbeque."[lr]::
10908::$$$message_0084_0019_0001$$$::"They're not gonna go out of their way to invite outsiders to such a fun get-together."::
10909::$$$message_0084_0020_0000$$$::"What? Really? Do you think good food is all it takes to entice me into going? Well, if it really is [font italic=true]that[font italic=false] important to you, yeah, I'll tag along then. Brace yourselves."[lr]::
10910::$$$message_0084_0020_0001$$$::What are we bracing ourselves for?[lr]::
10911::$$$message_0084_0020_0002$$$::Tohsaka makes those kinds of nasty remarks, but she seems willing to participate. Sakura also has a cheerful smile on her face.[lr]::
10912::$$$message_0084_0020_0003$$$::For now, Mitsuzuri nods, as the attendance of everyone here is confirmed.::
10913::$$$message_0084_0021_0000$$$::"Yeah. Then, let's do it at that place."[lr]::
10914::$$$message_0084_0021_0001$$$::"Oh, yes. So, the temple[line len=2]"[lr]::
10915::$$$message_0084_0021_0002$$$::"Huh? You're doing the training camp [wvl][se storage=se020.wav]at Ryudou Temple?"::
10916::$$$message_0084_0022_0000$$$::[chgfg time=300 storage=桜弓道着01g(中) textoff=0]Oh, we're out of time now. I can hear the sound of the bell from the school building.[lr]::
10917::$$$message_0084_0022_0001$$$::The range is far from the school building. I need to hurry back.[lr]::
10918::$$$message_0084_0022_0002$$$::A field trip or holding a barbeque would be nice, but a training camp isn't bad either.::
10919::$$$message_0084_0023_0000$$$::"H-hey, I didn't realize..."[lr]::
10920::$$$message_0084_0023_0001$$$::"Yeah, yeah, your attendance is already taken into account. No pulling out now that it's out there, Tohsaka.[lr]::
10921::$$$message_0084_0023_0002$$$::Once we've finalized stuff we can run it by the student council. Then on Sunday we'll go to Ryudou's place after practice."[lr]::
10922::$$$message_0084_0023_0003$$$::"Come on. You guys will be late if you don't hurry too."[lr]::
10923::$$$message_0084_0023_0004$$$::"Yes, Senpai!"::

